<h2 class="doc-sub" id="responsive">Tabla con desplazamiento horizontal</h2>
<p class="dg-muted dg-mb-4">Las tablas incluyen desplazamiento horizontal por defecto en su contenedor <code>dg-table-card</code> cuando no caben, sin agregar otra clase. Conserva las filas y columnas; para convertirlas en tarjetas, usa el ejemplo de tarjetas en móvil.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo is-plain" style="display:block"><div class="dg-table-card" role="region" aria-label="Tabla con desplazamiento horizontal" tabindex="0">
<table class="dg-table dg-table-wide">
  <caption class="dg-table-caption">Inventario de productos</caption>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col">Producto</th><th scope="col">Categoría</th><th scope="col" class="dg-cell-num">Stock</th><th scope="col" class="dg-cell-num">Precio</th><th scope="col">Proveedor</th><th scope="col">Actualización</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Cuaderno editorial</td><td>Papelería</td><td class="dg-cell-num">24</td><td class="dg-cell-num">$180.00</td><td>Estudio Norte</td><td>31 oct 2026</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Lámpara de escritorio</td><td>Iluminación</td><td class="dg-cell-num">8</td><td class="dg-cell-num">$950.00</td><td>Forma Local</td><td>30 oct 2026</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Organizador modular</td><td>Accesorios</td><td class="dg-cell-num">16</td><td class="dg-cell-num">$420.00</td><td>Taller Uno</td><td>29 oct 2026</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
</div></div>
<div class="doc-code"><button class="cp">Copiar</button><pre>&lt;div class="dg-table-card" role="region" aria-label="Tabla con desplazamiento horizontal" tabindex="0"&gt;
&lt;table class="dg-table dg-table-wide"&gt;
  &lt;caption class="dg-table-caption"&gt;Inventario de productos&lt;/caption&gt;
  &lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th scope="col"&gt;Producto&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th scope="col"&gt;Categoría&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th scope="col" class="dg-cell-num"&gt;Stock&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th scope="col" class="dg-cell-num"&gt;Precio&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th scope="col"&gt;Proveedor&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th scope="col"&gt;Actualización&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Cuaderno editorial&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Papelería&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class="dg-cell-num"&gt;24&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class="dg-cell-num"&gt;$180.00&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Estudio Norte&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;31 oct 2026&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Lámpara de escritorio&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Iluminación&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class="dg-cell-num"&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class="dg-cell-num"&gt;$950.00&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Forma Local&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;30 oct 2026&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Organizador modular&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Accesorios&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class="dg-cell-num"&gt;16&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class="dg-cell-num"&gt;$420.00&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Taller Uno&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;29 oct 2026&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</pre></div>
</div>
<h2 class="doc-sub" id="ordenable">Ordenable · seleccionable · con acciones</h2>
<p class="dg-muted dg-text-sm dg-mb-4">Para tablas de gestión: <code class="dg-code">.dg-sortable</code> marca las columnas ordenables, <code class="dg-code">.dg-cell-check</code> añade la selección por fila y cada fila puede incluir sus acciones.</p>
      <div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo is-plain">
        <div class="dg-table-card">
          <table class="dg-table dg-table-hover" data-dg-sortable id="ordersTable">
            <thead><tr>
              <th class="dg-cell-check"><label class="dg-check"><input type="checkbox" id="checkAll" aria-label="Seleccionar todas las filas" /><span class="dg-check-box"></span></label></th>
              <th class="dg-sortable">Cliente</th>
              <th class="dg-sortable">Estado</th>
              <th class="dg-sortable dg-cell-num">Total</th>
              <th class="dg-text-right">Acciones</th>
            </tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td class="dg-cell-check"><label class="dg-check"><input type="checkbox" class="rowCheck" aria-label="Seleccionar a Ana Rivas" /><span class="dg-check-box"></span></label></td>
                <td><div class="dg-cell-user"><span class="dg-avatar">AR</span>Ana Rivas</div></td>
                <td><span class="dg-badge dg-badge-dot dg-badge-success">Pagado</span></td>
                <td class="dg-cell-num" data-sort="128">$128.00</td>
                <td class="dg-text-right"><div class="dg-cell-actions"><button class="dg-icon-btn" aria-label="Editar"><svg class="dg-icon dg-icon-sm"><use href="#dg-mail"/></svg></button></div></td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="dg-cell-check"><label class="dg-check"><input type="checkbox" class="rowCheck" aria-label="Seleccionar a Luis Mora" /><span class="dg-check-box"></span></label></td>
                <td><div class="dg-cell-user"><span class="dg-avatar">LM</span>Luis Mora</div></td>
                <td><span class="dg-badge dg-badge-dot dg-badge-warning">Pendiente</span></td>
                <td class="dg-cell-num" data-sort="54.5">$54.50</td>
                <td class="dg-text-right"><div class="dg-cell-actions"><button class="dg-icon-btn" aria-label="Editar"><svg class="dg-icon dg-icon-sm"><use href="#dg-mail"/></svg></button></div></td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="dg-cell-check"><label class="dg-check"><input type="checkbox" class="rowCheck" aria-label="Seleccionar a Sofía Cano" /><span class="dg-check-box"></span></label></td>
                <td><div class="dg-cell-user"><span class="dg-avatar">SC</span>Sofía Cano</div></td>
                <td><span class="dg-badge dg-badge-dot dg-badge-success">Pagado</span></td>
                <td class="dg-cell-num" data-sort="312.2">$312.20</td>
                <td class="dg-text-right"><div class="dg-cell-actions"><button class="dg-icon-btn" aria-label="Editar"><svg class="dg-icon dg-icon-sm"><use href="#dg-mail"/></svg></button></div></td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="dg-text-xs dg-faint dg-mt-3">Pulsa una cabecera con flecha para ordenar. El checkbox de la cabecera selecciona todas las filas.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="doc-code"><button class="cp">Copiar</button><pre>&lt;div class="dg-table-card"&gt;
  &lt;table class="dg-table dg-table-hover" data-dg-sortable&gt;
    &lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr&gt;
      &lt;th class="dg-cell-check"&gt;
        &lt;label class="dg-check"&gt;&lt;input type="checkbox" /&gt;&lt;span class="dg-check-box"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;th class="dg-sortable"&gt;Cliente&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;th class="dg-sortable"&gt;Estado&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;th class="dg-sortable dg-cell-num"&gt;Total&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;th class="dg-text-right"&gt;Acciones&lt;/th&gt;
    &lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;
    &lt;tbody&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
        &lt;td class="dg-cell-check"&gt;
          &lt;label class="dg-check"&gt;&lt;input type="checkbox" /&gt;&lt;span class="dg-check-box"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
        &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;td&gt;&lt;div class="dg-cell-user"&gt;&lt;span class="dg-avatar"&gt;AR&lt;/span&gt;Ana Rivas&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;td&gt;&lt;span class="dg-badge dg-badge-dot dg-badge-success"&gt;Pagado&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;!-- data-sort: valor numérico usado para ordenar --&gt;
        &lt;td class="dg-cell-num" data-sort="128"&gt;$128.00&lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;td class="dg-text-right"&gt;
          &lt;div class="dg-cell-actions"&gt;
            &lt;button class="dg-icon-btn" aria-label="Editar"&gt;
              &lt;svg class="dg-icon dg-icon-sm"&gt;&lt;use href="dgarz-icons.svg#dg-edit"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
            &lt;/button&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;/tbody&gt;
  &lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;!-- data-dg-sortable + th.dg-sortable → ordena al hacer click (requiere dgarz.js).
     Al ordenar se emite el evento "dg:sort" con { column, ascending }.
     El checkbox de .dg-cell-check en thead selecciona todas las filas,
     marca cada &lt;tr&gt; con .is-selected y emite "dg:select" con { selected, total }. --&gt;</pre></div>
</div>

      <h2 class="doc-sub" id="compacta">Compacta · filas alternadas · cabecera fija</h2>
      <p class="dg-muted dg-text-sm dg-mb-4">Para mucha información: <code class="dg-code">.dg-table-sm</code> reduce la altura de las filas, <code class="dg-code">.dg-table-striped</code> alterna su fondo y <code class="dg-code">.dg-table-sticky</code> deja fija la cabecera.</p>
      <div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo is-plain">
        <div class="dg-table-card dg-table-sticky dg-scroll dg-h-200">
          <table class="dg-table dg-table-sm dg-table-striped">
            <thead><tr><th>Componente</th><th>Clase</th><th>Estado</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>Botón</td><td><code class="dg-code">.dg-btn</code></td><td><span class="dg-badge dg-badge-dot dg-badge-success">Listo</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td>Formulario</td><td><code class="dg-code">.dg-input</code></td><td><span class="dg-badge dg-badge-dot dg-badge-success">Listo</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td>Tabla</td><td><code class="dg-code">.dg-table</code></td><td><span class="dg-badge dg-badge-dot dg-badge-success">Listo</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td>Modal</td><td><code class="dg-code">.dg-modal</code></td><td><span class="dg-badge dg-badge-dot dg-badge-success">Listo</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td>Drawer</td><td><code class="dg-code">.dg-drawer</code></td><td><span class="dg-badge dg-badge-dot dg-badge-success">Listo</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td>Accordion</td><td><code class="dg-code">.dg-accordion</code></td><td><span class="dg-badge dg-badge-dot dg-badge-success">Listo</span></td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="doc-code"><button class="cp">Copiar</button><pre>&lt;!-- .dg-table-sticky: cabecera fija con scroll vertical (alto máx. 360px) --&gt;
&lt;div class="dg-table-card dg-table-sticky"&gt;
